      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Returning from the grave, Bonesy needs your help to put him back together!



    -
    Notice how the ghostly skeleton to the left has certain parts glowing in purple.


    -
    In the pit to the right, find the bone that matches the glowing piece.


    -
    Then, grab it and put it in the same spot where the glowing piece is. It should
    snap in place and lock itself.


    - Repeat this process until you finish building
    all of Bonesy!'
